# Generated by ./buildRelease from version.template + version.txt. It was listed here
# but still tracked (ignore rules do not apply to tracked files), so every build left
# it dirty -- which is how the 0.13.0 bump came to touch version.txt alone without any
# test noticing. Untracked as of this commit.
# NOTE: Version.version() loads it via ResourceBundle and throws MissingResourceException
# if absent, so build once (./buildRelease or make -C SMT build) after a fresh clone.
